<section class="home-section home-section--split" data-scroll-step aria-labelledby="research-title">
  <div class="home-section__heading">
    <span class="home-section__index" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
    <h2 id="research-title">Líneas de investigación</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="home-section__body" data-reveal-each>
    <p class="section-lead">Mi investigación se centra en desarrollar una inteligencia que entienda de verdad su entorno, en lugar de limitarse a identificar correlaciones estadísticas en los datos.</p>
    <p class="topic-hint" data-topic-hint hidden>Este es mi árbol de investigación. <span class="topic-hint__verb">Haz clic en</span><span class="topic-hint__verb topic-hint__verb--touch">Toca</span> cada elemento para saber <span class="topic-hint__end">más.<svg class="topic-hint__arrow" viewBox="0 0 40 48" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 5C23 6 33 19 25 42"/><path d="M17 35C20 37 23 40 25 43C27 40 29 37 32 34"/></svg></span></p>
  </div>

  <figure class="topic-tree" data-topic-tree>
    <ul class="topic-tree__list" aria-label="Mapa de investigación: la IA corporeizada plantea tres problemas, las tareas de largo horizonte, el metaaprendizaje y el aprendizaje continuo, que abordo con cuatro enfoques: modelos del mundo, estado de creencia, aprendizaje por refuerzo e IA multiagente">
      <li class="topic-tree__item">
        <button type="button" class="topic-tree__node topic-tree__node--root" aria-controls="topic-note-embodied">IA corporeizada</button>
        {% include "partials/topic-tree-branches.njk" %}
        <ul class="topic-tree__children topic-tree__children--hubs">
          <li class="topic-tree__item"><button type="button" class="topic-tree__node topic-tree__node--hub" aria-controls="topic-note-long">Tareas de largo horizonte</button></li>
          <li class="topic-tree__item"><button type="button" class="topic-tree__node topic-tree__node--hub" aria-controls="topic-note-meta">Meta&shy;aprendizaje</button></li>
          <li class="topic-tree__item"><button type="button" class="topic-tree__node topic-tree__node--hub" aria-controls="topic-note-continual">Aprendizaje continuo</button></li>
        </ul>
        {% include "partials/topic-tree-leaves.njk" %}
        <div class="topic-tree__group">
          <p class="topic-tree__group-label" id="topic-tree-group-label">Cómo lo abordo</p>
          <ul class="topic-tree__children topic-tree__children--fan" aria-labelledby="topic-tree-group-label">
            <li class="topic-tree__item"><button type="button" class="topic-tree__node" aria-controls="topic-note-world">Modelos del mundo</button></li>
